  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d34d9af03bd8a374c810bbfad858edf1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Info_Exhibit_03
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Museum.Runtime::Museum.ExhibitInfo
  title: "\u1EA4m men ng\u1ECDc c\xF3 n\u1EAFp"
  period: "Th\u1EDDi L\xFD ho\u1EB7c Tr\u1EA7n, th\u1EBF k\u1EF7 XIII\u2013XIV"
  material: "G\u1ED1m s\xE0nh, men ng\u1ECDc"
  origin: "B\u1EAFc Vi\u1EC7t Nam (\u0110\u1EA1i Vi\u1EC7t)"
  source: "Celadon Ewer and Cover, 13th - 14th C CE \u2014 B\u1EA3o t\xE0ng Ngh\u1EC7
    thu\u1EADt Minneapolis (Mia) (Sketchfab), gi\u1EA5y ph\xE9p CC0. B\u1EA3n qu\xE9t
    3D b\u1EB1ng ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p ch\u1EE5p \u1EA3nh (photogrammetry). Hi\u1EC7n
    v\u1EADt th\u1EADt cao 21 cm; tr\u01B0ng b\xE0y \u0111\xFAng k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc
    th\u1EADt."
  summary: "\u1EA4m g\u1ED1m men ng\u1ECDc c\u1EE7a \u0110\u1EA1i Vi\u1EC7t, th\u1EBF
    k\u1EF7 XIII\u2013XIV. V\xF2i \u1EA5m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\u1EB7n theo h\xECnh
    \u0111\u1EA7u makara, m\u1ED9t lo\xE0i th\u1EE7y qu\xE1i trong th\u1EA7n tho\u1EA1i."
  story: "Ngh\u1EC1 g\u1ED1m \u1EDF mi\u1EC1n B\u1EAFc Vi\u1EC7t Nam ph\xE1t tri\u1EC3n
    m\u1EA1nh d\u01B0\u1EDBi th\u1EDDi L\xFD (1009\u20131225) v\xE0 th\u1EDDi Tr\u1EA7n
    (1225\u20131400). Th\u1EE3 g\u1ED1m Vi\u1EC7t ti\u1EBFp thu ki\u1EC3u d\xE1ng
    v\xE0 men g\u1ED1m Trung Hoa nh\u01B0ng hay th\u1EED nghi\u1EC7m c\xE1ch l\xE0m
    ri\xEAng. S\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u01B0a chu\u1ED9ng
    trong n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c xu\u1EA5t kh\u1EA9u.\n\n\u1EA4m
    \u0111\u1EF1ng r\u01B0\u1EE3u, n\u01B0\u1EDBc ho\u1EB7c tr\xE0 c\xF3 th\xE2n
    ph\xECnh v\xE0 v\xF2i ng\u1EAFn r\u1EA5t ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn th\u1EDDi L\xFD \u2013
    Tr\u1EA7n. V\xF2i c\u1EE7a chi\u1EBFc \u1EA5m n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\u1EB7n
    theo h\xECnh \u0111\u1EA7u makara, m\u1ED9t lo\xE0i th\u1EE7y qu\xE1i trong th\u1EA7n
    tho\u1EA1i.\n\nMen ng\u1ECDc l\xE0 l\u1EDBp men trong, m\xE0u xanh l\u1EE5c.
    M\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng r\u1EA5t nh\u1ECF \xF4-x\xEDt s\u1EAFt trong men t\u1EA1o
    ra m\xE0u t\u1EEB v\xE0ng nh\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EBFn xanh \xF4 liu. Hoa v\u0103n
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c kh\u1EAFc ch\xECm tr\xEAn th\xE2n \u1EA5m, n\xEAn men \u0111\u1ECDng
    d\xE0y h\u01A1n \u1EDF c\xE1c r\xE3nh v\xE0 l\xE0m hoa v\u0103n n\u1ED5i l\xEAn.\n\nHi\u1EC7n
    v\u1EADt th\u1EADt cao 21 cm, thu\u1ED9c b\u1ED9 s\u01B0u t\u1EADp c\u1EE7a B\u1EA3o
    t\xE0ng Ngh\u1EC7 thu\u1EADt Minneapolis (Hoa K\u1EF3)."
